  "question": {
    "text": "<p>An electric dipole is placed at the origin and is directed along the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis. At a point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>, far away from the dipole, the electric field is parallel to the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>P</mi></math>&nbsp;makes an angle <math> <mrow> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </math> with the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>-axis, then</p>\r"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>&theta;</mi> <mo>=</mo> <msqrt> <mn>3</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> <mo>=</mo> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mi>&theta;</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>4</mn> <msup> <mn>5</mn> <mo>∘</mo> </msup> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>&theta;</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> <mo>/</mo> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Direction of the electric field from the axis of the dipole is given by <math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mi>θ</mi> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </msup> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Here given that E is along the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis.<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mi>θ</mi> <mo>+</mo> <msup> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mrow> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </msup> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mi>π</mi> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0096_b0195ee0a91c.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 200px;\" /><br /><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>cot</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mo>cot</mo> <mi>θ</mi> <mo>&nbsp;⇒&nbsp;</mo> <msup> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mi>θ</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</mo> <mtext>tan</mtext> <mi>θ</mi> <mo>=</mo> <msqrt> <mn>2</mn> </msqrt> </mrow> </math>"
  }
